cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FIGS, please cite the paper below."
type: dataset
title: "FIGS: Evaluating Multi-Turn Sycophancy Without Penalizing Empathy"
abstract: >-
  FIGS is a 500-scenario, multi-turn benchmark for sycophancy and calibrated
  validation, with a live user simulator and a frozen dual-axis judge.
